# Uvagf · 07 · Juvpu srrqref jrag dhvrg?

## Uvag 1

N ebyy pnyy pbzcnerf 2 guvatf: gur anzrf lbh rkcrpg naq gur anzrf lbh fnj. Orsber lbh jevgr n
ybbc, nfx sbe rnpu fvqr: juvpu fgehpgher nafjref "vf guvf anzr va urer?" ng bapr, jvgubhg n ybbc,
naq jvgubhg pnevat ubj bsgra gur anzr jnf jevggra? Gura nfx jung lbh arrq gb xabj nobhg rnpu anzr
lbh fnj. Vg vf abg rirel urnegorng; vg vf 1 gvzr cre srrqre.

Sbe gur obhaqnel, jevgr 4 ntrf ba cncre orsber lbh pbqr: 29 zva 59 f, rknpgyl 30 zva, 30 zva cyhf
1 af, naq zvahf 2 zva (n pybpx gung ehaf nurnq). Chg rnpu va vgf yvfg. Gura cvpx gur bar pbzcnevfba
gung chgf nyy 4 jurer lbh jebgr gurz.

## Uvag 2

Qb vg va 2 cnffrf. Svefg erqhpr gur urnegorngf gb n znc sebz srrqre gb vgf yngrfg gvzr: gung znc
vf nyernql `YnfgFrra`. "Yngrfg" zrnaf lbh ercynpr gur fgberq gvzr bayl jura gur arj bar vf
`Nsgre` vg. N cynva `z[anzr] = o.Ng` xrrcf gur ynfg urnegorng va gur fyvpr, juvpu vf n qvssrerag
guvat. Gura znxr n frg bs gur vairagbel (`znc[fgevat]fgehpg{}`); gur qhcyvpngrf qvfnccrne ol
gurzfryirf.

3 gencf:

- N zvffvat xrl va n `znc[fgevat]gvzr.Gvzr` tvirf gur mreb gvzr, juvpu ybbxf yvxr "irel fgnyr".
  Hfr gur pbzzn-bx sbez gb gryy "ab urnegorng" sebz "na byq urnegorng".
- Enatvat bire n znc tvirf n enaqbz beqre. Fbeg gur xrlf naq enatr bire gurz, naq rirel yvfg lbh
  ohvyq pbzrf bhg fbegrq jvgubhg n frcnengr fbeg.
- `fyvprf.Fbeg(vairagbel)` fbegf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr. Gur frg nyernql unf rirel anzr lbh arrq.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `CnefrUrnegorng`: fcyvg jvgu `fgevatf.Svryqf`; nalguvat ohg 2 svryqf vf na reebe. Cnefr gur
   frpbaq svryq jvgu `gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339, ...)`. Ohvyq rirel reebe jvgu `szg.Reebes`, `%j` sbe
   `ReeZnysbezrq` naq `%d` sbe gur yvar, naq erghea `Urnegorng{}` jvgu vg.
2. `EbyyPnyy`, cnff 1: znxr gur `YnfgFrra` znc jvgu `znxr`, fb vg vf arire avy. Sbe rnpu urnegorng
   jvgu n aba-rzcgl anzr, fgber vgf gvzr jura gur srrqre unf ab gvzr lrg be gur arj gvzr vf
   `Nsgre` gur fgberq bar.
3. Znxr gur vairagbel frg. Fxvc gur rzcgl anzr.
4. Enatr bire gur fbegrq xrlf bs gur frg. Ybbx rnpu anzr hc va `YnfgFrra` jvgu pbzzn-bx: abg sbhaq
   tbrf gb `Zvffvat`; `abj.Fho(ynfg) > fgnyrNsgre` tbrf gb `Fgnyr`; rirelguvat ryfr gb `Urnygul`.
5. Enatr bire gur fbegrq xrlf bs `YnfgFrra`. Rirel anzr gung vf abg va gur frg tbrf gb `Haxabja`.
6. Erghea gur ercbeg jvgu gur 4 yvfgf naq gur znc.
